{{#if (eq this.supportedKind 'airplay')}}
  <Docs::CurrentBrowser /> supports <strong>AirPlay</strong>. The button below
  opens the AirPlay picker, which lists whatever receivers it finds.
{{else if (eq this.supportedKind 'chromecast')}}
  <Docs::CurrentBrowser /> supports <strong>Chromecast</strong>. The button
  below lights up once a Chromecast is on your network.
{{else}}
  <Docs::CurrentBrowser /> has <strong>no casting support</strong>. Neither
  AirPlay nor Chromecast is available here, so the button below stays disabled
  no matter what is on your network. Try Safari for AirPlay, or Chrome for
  Chromecast.
{{/if}}
